Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:17:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ep4 (ltx1): overlap chaining carry (O1) + 1080p memory work
 (M1-M6)

O1: _ltx_carry / _ltx_last: condition a chunk on the previous chunk tail latents (official next_video_carry_frames method).
M1: LTX_MEMLOG=1 DRAM ledger lines (+ LTX_MEMDUMP allocator dump).
M2: LTX_AUX_EVICT=1 frees VAE/upsampler/audio weights before the denoise (off: reload costs time).
M3: key-padding mask SDPA in query chunks sharing one (1,1,chunk,Sk) mask instead of an N x N mask (bit-identical).
M4: one key-mask cache for all attention modules (was one copy per module).
M5: LTX_CCL_FREE=1 frees per-shape CCL ping-pong buffers after each stage and the VAE (bit-identical; +16 s warm at 121 frames, so only for long single passes).
M6: LTX_FFN_CHUNK sequence-chunked FFN (off: +10 s at 121 frames, does not fix 241/249).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
